# Post-Modification Validation Gate (修改后必跑验证)

## Scope
This rule applies to ALL code changes made in this project.

## Rule
After EVERY code change, the agent MUST immediately run the full validation sequence. The change is NOT considered complete until all checks pass.

### Mandatory Validation Sequence
Run these commands in order after each code modification:

```bash
npm run lint        # ESLint
npm test            # Vitest
npm run build       # Vite production build
npx tsc --noEmit    # TypeScript type-checking
```

### Workflow
1. Make the code change
2. Run the full validation sequence above
3. If ANY check fails:
   - Fix the root cause in the code
   - Re-run the full sequence from the beginning
   - Repeat until ALL checks pass
4. Only when ALL checks pass is the modification considered complete

### Critical Notes
- Do NOT skip any step in the sequence
- Do NOT hand back to the user with failing validation — fix it first
- For high-risk UI changes (simulation/table/reserves), also check `docs/conventions/frontend-regression-checklist.md`
